      "fix": "Update PrimaryButton to use theme.roundness for borderRadius, theme.spacing.lg for minWidth (≥120 px) and minHeight (48 px), and apply a 2 px solid focus ring using theme.colors.primary. Ensure pressed state uses theme.colors.primaryVariant."
